n standing next to car"},{"id":"A1-M05-P1-004","module":"A1-M05 Possessives · P1","part":"P1 Foundation","stage":"Foundation","order":4,"level":"A1","topic":"Possession","scenario":"Stating ownership of an object (female)","grammar":"Subject + her + noun","highlights":"Her ile sahiplik (kadın)","pattern":"","en":"This is her bag.","tr":"Bu onun çantası.","ipa":"/ðɪs ɪz hɜr bæg/","trPron":"Dis iz hır bag","tense":"Present Simple","collocations":"her bag, is her","synonyms":"purse, backpack","antonyms":"none","commonMistake":"This is she bag. ❌","aiExplain":"Her iyelik sıfatıdır, \"she\" özne zamiridir. \"She bag\" yanlıştır.","grammarTags":"possessive, feminine, object","imgQuery":"woman holding a purse"},{"id":"A1-M05-P1-005","module":"A1-M05 Possessives · P1","part":"P1 Foundation","stage":"Foundation","order":5,"level":"A1","topic":"Possession","scenario":"Plural possession","grammar":"Subject + our + noun","highlights":"Our ile çoğul sahiplik","pattern":"Present Simple","en":"our house, is our","tr":"house, houses, housing","ipa":"home, dwelling","trPron":"apartment","tense":"Proud","collocations":"Our iyelik sıfatı isimden önce gelir. \"House of us\" yanlıştır.","synonyms":"front door sound","antonyms":"possessive, plural, home","commonMistake":"A1","aiExplain":"","grammarTags":""},{"id":"A1-M05-P1-006","module":"A1-M05 Possessives · P1","part":"P1 Foundation","stage":"Foundation","order":6,"level":"A1","topic":"Possession","scenario":"Third person plural possession","grammar":"Subject + their + noun","highlights":"Their ile sahiplik","pattern":"","en":"Their children are very friendly.","tr":"Onların çocukları çok arkadaş canlısı.","ipa":"/ðɛr ˈʧɪldrən ɑr ˈvɛri ˈfrɛndli/","trPron":"Der çıldrın ar veri frendli","tense":"Present Simple","collocations":"their children, are their","synonyms":"kid, offspring","antonyms":"parent, adult","commonMistake":"Them children are very friendly. ❌","aiExplain":"Their iyelik sıfatıdır, \"them\" ise nesne zamiridir.","grammarTag