tiful.","tr":"Onun elbisesi güzel.","ipa":"/hɜr drɛs ɪz ˈbjutəfəl/","trPron":"Hır dres iz byutıfıl","tense":"Present Simple","collocations":"her dress, dress is","synonyms":"gown, outfit","antonyms":"none","commonMistake":"She dress is beautiful. ❌","aiExplain":"She dress yanlıştır.","grammarTags":"possessive, clothing, adjective","imgQuery":"woman in beautiful dress"},{"id":"A1-M05-P1-019","module":"A1-M05 Possessives · P1","part":"P1 Foundation","stage":"Foundation","order":19,"level":"A1","topic":"Possession","scenario":"Stating a collective possession","grammar":"Our + noun","highlights":"Bizim...","pattern":"","en":"Our apartment is on the third floor.","tr":"Bizim dairemiz üçüncü katta.","ipa":"/ˈaʊər əˈpɑrtmənt ɪz ɑn ðə θɜrd flɔr/","trPron":"Auır ıpartmınt iz on dı thırd flor","tense":"Present Simple","collocations":"our apartment, apartment is","synonyms":"home, residence","antonyms":"house, none","commonMistake":"Apartment of us is on the third floor. ❌","aiExplain":"Our apartment doğru, \"apartment of us\" yanlıştır.","grammarTags":"possessive, home, location","imgQuery":"apartment building with elevator"},{"id":"A1-M05-P1-020","module":"A1-M05 Possessives · P1","part":"P1 Foundation","stage":"Foundation","order":20,"level":"A1","topic":"Possession","scenario":"Stating a person's item (with name)","grammar":"Name + 's + noun (Apostrophe S)","highlights":"İsmin iyelik hali","pattern":"Present Simple","en":"Ali's phone, is Ali's","tr":"phone, phoning, phoned","ipa":"cell, mobile","trPron":"none","tense":"Informal","collocations":"Neutral","synonyms":"man holding phone with name sticker","antonyms":"office sound","commonMistake":"A1","aiExplain":"possessive, apostrophe, name","grammarTags":""},{"id":"A1-M05-P1-021","module":"A1-M05 Possessives · P1","part":"P1 Foundation","stage":"Foundation","order":21,"level":"A1","topic":"Possession","scenario":"Asking about ownership (female)","grammar":"Is this + her + noun?","highlights":"Bu onun ... mu?","pattern":"","